{title: Yaara}
{artist: Arnab Dutta 1921}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am] Tu neend bhi hai khwab bhi,        [G] Hai aankh mein meri
[F] Teri hi aag jal rahi,        [G] Hai raakh mein [Am] meri
[Am] Hansu teri khushi me,        [G] Ghum mein roun main
[F] Tere hi saath jaagun main,        [G] Tujh hi me soun [Am] main
Jeena [C] mera marna [E] mera,        [F] Tu hi toh [G] hai ab [Am] mera
Tu jo [C] nahi kuch bhi [E] nahi,        Tu [F] hi toh hai [G] sab [AM] mera
[Am] Yaara tu mujh me [F] yun basa,        [Dm] Mujh me rahi na [E] meri jagah
[Am] Phaila hai tu meri [F] rooh tak,        [Dm] Mujh me hi main [E] jeene laga
[Am] Chale tu meri saans mein,        [G] Safar tera hoon main
[F] Tu chodhke na jaana mujh ko,        [G] har tera hoon [Am] main
[Am] Rahega mere sath mujh se,        [G] Vaada kar le tu
[F] Aaj mujh se pyaar thoda,        [G] Zyada kar le [Am] tu
[C] Tere bina kya hai [E] mera,        [F] Tu hi toh [G] jahan hai [Am] mera
[C] Meri zameen mera [E] yakeen,        [F] Tu hi aas [G] maan [Am] mera hai
[Am] Yaara tu mujh me [F] yun basa,        [Dm] Mujh me rahi na [E] meri jagah
[Am] Phaila hai tu meri [F] rooh tak,        [Dm] Mujh me hi main [E] jeene laga
[Am] Tu ab me hai tu hi [F] baad mein,        Tu hi [E] rubaroo tu hi yaad mein
[F] Jitna tha main tera ho gaya,        [E] Apna bhi main na raha
[Am] Yaara tu mujh me [F] yun basa,        [Dm] Mujh me rahi na [E] meri jagah
[Am] Phaila hai tu meri [F] rooh tak,        [Dm] Mujh me hi main [E] jeene
